  unitName: Capricorn of Devotion (EU)
  unitId: 730176
  unitNumber: 7136
  description: When Shera opened her eyes, she was surprised for a moment, not just
    because she was alive, but because of the change in her... The fate of her companions
    no longer concerned her and her powers were no longer the same. And suddenly
    she became aware of the emptiness inside her. She no longer felt anything. She
    travelled, crossing incredible worlds she had never suspected the existence of,
    without any of it inspiring the least interest in her. She killed, cut short
    lives, and spread the Corruption flawlessly, doing what had to be done in obedience
    to a will that was no longer her own.
  summonDesc: I have been reborn, changed, in this world. Corrupted.
  fusionDesc: The Corruption will spread.
